<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Dec 96 load factor up at 65.4pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Dec 96 load factor up at 65.4pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG said it improved its group passenger load factor in December by 1.9 percentage points to 65.4 percent compared to 12 months previously.</p>
<p>The following table from the airline's investor relations department shows Lufthansa group passenger traffic for December 1996.</p>
<p>Total passengers (group) (million)  2.85  up 1.5 pct</p>
<p>Available seat kilometres (million) 9.33  up 5.1 pct</p>
<p>Revenue seat kilometres (million)   6.10  up 8.2 pct</p>
<p>    Passenger load factor	     65.4  up 1.9 pct points.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
